- Nothing says so outside ADR 0018: no POD, README, META, Makefile.PL OS check.
- Predicted FAILs: t/10-lib.t node-path subtests (chdir '/' at 1400, 1447), EISDIR message 1505, non-ASCII file names 1494-1499, flock LOCK_EX read 1520-1531, chmod 0000 1536-1541; corpus render-loaders (53 cases, POSIX-absolute expectations). Likely PASS: t/10-loader.t string-only cases, api.t with normEOL.
- With no os_unsupported gate CPAN Testers on MSWin32 report FAIL, not NA.
